{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31034","headline":"送赵道士归天目旧山 · 薛能","name":"送赵道士归天目旧山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"愚朴尚公平，此心邻道情。\n有缘终自鄙，何计逐师行。\n日者闻高躅，时人盖强名。\n口无滋味入，身有羽仪生。\n奏乞还乡远，诗曾对御成。\n土毛珍到越，尘发倦离京。\n符叱风雷恶，朝修月露清。\n观临天目顶，家住海潮声。\n道引图看足，参同注解精。\n休粮一拟问，窗草俟回程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}